BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:BACKHOME: CARIBANA EDITION
DTSTART:20260731T220000
DTEND:20260731T220000
UID:2a1e4efdb7390d0a95d4142320b7dc33@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:BACKHOME: Caribana Edition celebrates the sound of the Caribbe
 an diaspora through a blend of global rhythms. An immersive night geared i
 n making the crowd get lost in the music\, dance freely\, and feel a deep 
