DTEND:20260829T110000
UID:40097c080a5b7a02282edd3e87301c03@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Summer heat has you itching for a beach day? Well look no furt
 her\, Lez Beach is back! We’re collabing with our baddies at @gyalsegmen
 t again for an entire day of free music and food in the grass alongside fr
 ee vibes on the beach 🏖️🌈🌞 Chilling not your vibe? We also have
  a FULL lineup of beach activities to keep you satiated throughout the day
 . 🕑2PM✨A sapphic\, beach-themed drag show with a STACKED cast hosted 
 by @anne__alien 📍 In the grass 🕓4PM✨ Twerk contest in the grass ho
 sted by @gyalsegment 📍 In the grass 🕕6PM✨ An all trans wet T4Tshir
 t contest with @sapphics_raise_the_bar &amp\; @sebastianurmom📍In the sa
 nd at Trail 3 More info on the drag show lineup and how to enter the conte
 sts coming soon! Also free ferry tickets of course. Follow us so you don
 ’t miss it 👀 Free stickers and community supplies at our table like a
 lways! Proceeds from our remaining PWYC Kuffiyeh Lez Beach stickers going 
 to @helpsondos @hairbysondos. Thank you to @c1foundation\, @citypoolwarrio
 r and everyone who has donated in the past. Community effort keeps this ga
 thering alive! Lez Beach is first and foremost a grassroots gathering to c
 ombat rising levels of harassment and exclusion towards lesbians in queer 
 spaces. Hanlan’s Point Beach is a public\, clothing optional space and w
 e cannot control who can and who cannot enter the space during Lez Beach. 
 If you have concerns about the crowd\, please come sit with us at the entr
 ance to the event! We keep each other safe. If you’ve never attended bef
 ore\, take a look at our FAQ posts! This is a gathering to encourage safet
 y and reclaim space for sapphics in the queer community. There is zero tol
 erance for racism\, transphobia\, fatphobia or misogyny. If you do not con
 nect to the sapphic experience\, we ask you to reconsider the space you’
 re entering. Poster by @artbylid Map by @azaydrea ‍
LOCATION:Hanlan&#x27\;s Point Beach\, Toronto Islands
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/lez-beach-3
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
