DTSTART:20260829T190000
DTEND:20260829T190000
UID:91886688a395364b54a7b6e5865eb07b@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:A show celebrating body diversity and self love through drag\,
  burlesque in the west end of Toronto. Welcome back to another edition of 
 Beef Curtains a show where we celebrate people of all shapes\, sizes and g
 ender identities. In this edition we celebrate and feature a full lineup o
 f body positive burlesque artists and drag artists. In a world that tells 
 us to change how we look and who we are\, lets band together to show them 
 exactly who we are. This show is produced and hosted by Toronto&#x27\;s or
 ginal AFAB drag queen Dottie Dangerfield. You can follow Dottie at thereal
 dottiedangerfield on instagram for more future shows! Dottie created this 
 show in 2016 and this show has been revived for 2026. Our Lineup: Dottie D
 angerfield (therealdottiedangerfield) Seyonce Knowles (SeyonceKnows) KingC
 hella (kingchella) Snack Baby (snackbabythiccums) Oxymoron (Oxymoro.n) Mis
